{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Goo Go&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/fb2a13cb5e17dfd2b215ca11fbc80707.poster.avif?t=1767802448\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/fb2a13cb5e17dfd2b215ca11fbc80707.webm?t=1767802448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Goo using a triple jump and movement keys to overcome obstacles and climb higher and higher. It\u2019s a game that will test your skills, patience, and, of course, the strength of your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult but not impossible gameplay.</strong> Perseverance and practice will help you reach the top. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/dd2e2b68b4626531aae2cd93baae4079.poster.avif?t=1767802448\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/dd2e2b68b4626531aae2cd93baae4079.webm?t=1767802448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every obstacle is designed with intent</strong> and requires precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused gameplay</strong> without distracting elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are immortal!</strong> But every mistake or excessive rush will send you back to the very start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, slide, fall, and start again.</strong> And again, and again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/42045155560689a956b6bed435660638.poster.avif?t=1767802448\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/42045155560689a956b6bed435660638.webm?t=1767802448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A test of endurance and patience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Note from the developer:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by one person at the peak of motivation and its rapid fading due to emotional burnout. I was inspired by &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy,&quot; &quot;A Difficult Game About Climbing,&quot; and the first version of &quot;Only Up!&quot; These games are an homage to the older &quot;Sexy Hiking&quot; by Jazzuo. I have mixed feelings about such games: I hate and love them at the same time. They burn through your neurons, but at the same time, they make you cherish your achievements. I wanted to contribute to the &quot;Foddian&quot; genre and create something unusual, not just a clone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wish you luck and patience! My apologies if the game doesn't meet your expectations. To be honest, I didn't create a masterpiece; it\u2019s far from it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3030820?t=1767802448","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767802448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767802448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767802448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Goo Go&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/fb2a13cb5e17dfd2b215ca11fbc80707.poster.avif?t=1767802448\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/fb2a13cb5e17dfd2b215ca11fbc80707.webm?t=1767802448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Goo using a triple jump and movement keys to overcome obstacles and climb higher and higher. It\u2019s a game that will test your skills, patience, and, of course, the strength of your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult but not impossible gameplay.</strong> Perseverance and practice will help you reach the top. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/dd2e2b68b4626531aae2cd93baae4079.poster.avif?t=1767802448\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/dd2e2b68b4626531aae2cd93baae4079.webm?t=1767802448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every obstacle is designed with intent</strong> and requires precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused gameplay</strong> without distracting elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are immortal!</strong> But every mistake or excessive rush will send you back to the very start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, slide, fall, and start again.</strong> And again, and again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/42045155560689a956b6bed435660638.poster.avif?t=1767802448\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/42045155560689a956b6bed435660638.webm?t=1767802448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A test of endurance and patience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Note from the developer:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by one person at the peak of motivation and its rapid fading due to emotional burnout. I was inspired by &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy,&quot; &quot;A Difficult Game About Climbing,&quot; and the first version of &quot;Only Up!&quot; These games are an homage to the older &quot;Sexy Hiking&quot; by Jazzuo. I have mixed feelings about such games: I hate and love them at the same time. They burn through your neurons, but at the same time, they make you cherish your achievements. I wanted to contribute to the &quot;Foddian&quot; genre and create something unusual, not just a clone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wish you luck and patience! My apologies if the game doesn't meet your expectations. To be honest, I didn't create a masterpiece; it\u2019s far from it.</p>","developers":["Draft Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/header.jpg?t=1767802448","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Goo Go a game developed by Draft Games. Goo Go and its logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of Draft Games. The game is the property of Draft Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3030820/707759/d1d2e26fc660b01904c58adc8d01f4aa52679bbd/1750959421/dash_av1.mpd?t=1717554655","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3030820/707759/d1d2e26fc660b01904c58adc8d01f4aa52679bbd/1750959421/dash_h264.mpd?t=1717554655","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3030820/707759/d1d2e26fc660b01904c58adc8d01f4aa52679bbd/1750959421/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1717554655","id":257027437,"name":"Goo Go - semi Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257027437/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1717554655"}],"name":"Goo Go","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Goo Go - $0.99 USD","packageid":1077622,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":99}],"title":"Buy Goo Go"}],"packages":[1077622],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB availabl